{title: Jaiye Aap Kahan Jayenge}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Jaiye aap kahan jayenge,
[F]ye nazar [G]laut ke [Am]phir aayegi
[F]ye nazar [G]laut ke [Am]phir aayegi
[Am]Door tak [F]aap ke [G]pichhe pichhe
[Am]Door tak [F]aap ke [G]pichhe pichhe
[D]Meri aawaz [Am]chali jayegi
[G]Aapako pyaar mera [Am]yaad jaha aayega
[G]Koi kaanta wohi [Am]daaman se lipat jayega
[F]Koi kanta [G]wohi daman [Am]se lipat jayega
[Am]Jaiye aap kahan jayenge......
[G]Jab uthoge meri [Am]betab nigahon ki tarah
[G]Rok lengi koi dali [Am]meri baahon ki tarah
[F]Rok lengi [G]koi dali meri [Am]baahon ki tarah
[Am]Jaiye aap kahan jayenge......
[G]Dekhiye chain milega na [Am]kahi dil ke siva
[G]Aapaka koi nahi koi [Am]nahi dil ke siva
[F]Aapaka koi [G]nahi koi nahi [Am]dil ke siva
[Am]Jaiye aap kahan jayenge......
